,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids has come in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years for August to September and for November to December. The end of 2025 ran short there, with October to November at 64% and November to December at 60% of normal in 2025. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21519 had its driest year in 1965 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
